{"seq":3,"slug":"lease-leak-watch-backlog-tuning","title":"租约泄漏、Watch 堆积与压缩调优实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/lease-watch-mvcc/lease-leak-watch-backlog-tuning","wordCount":2026,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"租约泄漏-watch-堆积与压缩调优实操\">租约泄漏、Watch 堆积与压缩调优实操</h1><p>库存预占服务做了一次滚动发布，新旧两个 ReplicaSet 各起了一批 goroutine。新 Pod 全都退出了，但每个旧 Pod 崩溃前 <code>LeaseGrant</code> 出来的租约，被它在另一个可用区的 sidecar 继续每 3 秒续约一次——<code>etcd_debugging_lease_granted_total</code> 一路爬升，<code>leaseMap</code> 无上限增长，内存曲线跟着涨；同一周，某个自研 Operator 的 Watch 消费逻辑慢了一拍，服务端把它移进 <code>victims</code>，<code>etcd_debugging_mvcc_pending_events_total</code> 抬升；两周后运维想 defrag 释放空间，发现 <code>etcdctl defrag</code> 会被 OOM 杀。三件事看起来无关，实际是同一套 revision 空间在计费。本文按「先辨类型 → 再定量 → 后处置」的顺序讲清这三条链路的实操。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三种-泄漏-共用一套-mvcc-计数\">核心概念：三种「泄漏」共用一套 MVCC 计数</h2><p>etcd 的内存与磁盘压力几乎总从三个出口泄出，而它们并不是三个独立的问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>承载结构</th>\n<th>主指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>租约泄漏</td>\n<td><code>lessor.leaseMap</code>（纯内存，不落 MVCC）</td>\n<td><code>etcd_debugging_lease_granted_total</code> vs <code>etcd_debugging_lease_revoked_total</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Watch 堆积</td>\n<td><code>watchableStore</code> 的 <code>unsynced</code> / <code>victims</code> 集合</td>\n<td><code>etcd_debugging_mvcc_pending_events_total</code>、<code>etcd_debugging_mvcc_slow_watcher_total</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩滞后</td>\n<td>bbolt 的 <code>key</code> / <code>meta</code> bucket</td>\n<td><code>etcd_mvcc_db_total_size_in_bytes</code> 与 <code>etcd_mvcc_db_total_size_in_use_in_bytes</code> 之差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者的公共分母是 <strong>revision 生成速率</strong>。租约续约本身不改 revision，但租约<strong>过期产生的那次 Raft 删除提案</strong>会推高 revision 并生成 DELETE 事件，事件又去喂所有 Watch 消费者——所以租约泄漏会放大 Watch 堆积；Watch 堆积的客户端若按 <code>StartRev</code> 补历史，又会被压缩水位卡住。理解这条耦合，才不会在三个指标里做局部优化。</p>\n<p>租约泄漏速率的量化很直接：设单位时间新增租约数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、被 revoke/expire 的为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 <code>leaseMap</code> 的净增长为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>lease</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dN_{\\text{lease}}}{dt} = \\lambda_g - \\lambda_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lease</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_g &gt; \\lambda_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 持续存在，内存就是发散的——etcd 对租约数量<strong>没有任何硬上限</strong>，这是「泄漏」在 etcd 里的准确含义：不是某个 bug，而是净增长无人观测。同理，压缩滞后写成一阶滞后：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>lag</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>latestRevision</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>compactRevision</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>lastCompact</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{lag} = \\text{latestRevision} - \\text{compactRevision} \\approx \\dot{R} \\cdot (t_{\\text{now}} - t_{\\text{lastCompact}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lag</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">latestRevision</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">compactRevision</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lastCompact</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 revision 生成速率。当 lag 乘以平均记录体积超过配额时，就进入下文 NOSPACE 的处置路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;发布/重启导致旧租约未 revoke&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;sidecar 持续 keepalive&lt;br/&gt;leaseMap 净增长&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;内存上升 + 过期删除提案增多&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;DELETE 事件涌入 watchableStore&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;消费者跟得上?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[&quot;移入 victims&lt;br/&gt;pending_events 抬升&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G[&quot;正常消费&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H{&quot;StartRev 已被压缩?&quot;}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[&quot;取消 watch&lt;br/&gt;ErrCompacted&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| E&#10;    B --&gt; J[&quot;内存压力 → defrag 被 OOM 杀&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"发布/重启导致旧租约未 revoke\"] --&gt; B[\"sidecar 持续 keepalive&lt;br/&gt;leaseMap 净增长\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"内存上升 + 过期删除提案增多\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"DELETE 事件涌入 watchableStore\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"消费者跟得上?\"}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[\"移入 victims&lt;br/&gt;pending_events 抬升\"]\n    E --&gt;|是| G[\"正常消费\"]\n    F --&gt; H{\"StartRev 已被压缩?\"}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[\"取消 watch&lt;br/&gt;ErrCompacted\"]\n    H --&gt;|否| E\n    B --&gt; J[\"内存压力 → defrag 被 OOM 杀\"]</pre><h2 id=\"租约泄漏-识别-归因与清理\">租约泄漏：识别、归因与清理</h2><p>etcd 的租约是挂在 MVCC 上的 TTL 聚合根（见同章节 <a href=\"lease-watch-stream-mechanism\">Lease 租约与 Watch 事件流机制</a>），最小 TTL 为 2 秒，低于它 <code>LeaseGrant</code> 直接报错（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/learning/api/\">etcd API</a>）。识别泄漏的第一步是<strong>枚举存量租约及其挂载键</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"ETCDCTL_API=3 etcdctl lease list&#10;ETCDCTL_API=3 etcdctl lease timetolive &lt;lease-id&gt; --keys&#10;ETCDCTL_API=3 etcdctl lease revoke &lt;lease-id&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ETCDCTL_API</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lease</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ETCDCTL_API</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lease</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> timetolive</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">lease-i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --keys</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ETCDCTL_API</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lease</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> revoke</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">lease-i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>lease list</code> 只列出<strong>未过期且未挂键</strong>的租约；带 <code>--keys</code> 的 <code>timetolive</code> 才能看到哪些 key 被绑着。生产上的排查姿势是：先看 <code>etcd_debugging_lease_granted_total - etcd_debugging_lease_revoked_total - etcd_debugging_server_lease_expired_total</code> 的差值是否随时间单调上升——若上升，说明存在「有人持续续约、但业务方已不认为自己持有」的租约。这类租约不会自己过期，因为 keepalive 一直喂着它。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>客户端崩溃但续约方仍在（多副本/sidecar 各自续约）</td>\n<td><code>lease list</code> 数量随发布次数阶梯上升</td>\n<td>续约收敛到单一 owner；进程退出路径显式 <code>revoke</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用长 TTL 当「永久键」</td>\n<td>TTL 极大、<code>timetolive</code> 剩余时间长期不降</td>\n<td>改用无 lease 的普通键，别拿租约做存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>checkpoint 让长租约「无限自动续命」</td>\n<td>重启后仍存活、<code>lease granted</code> 不增</td>\n<td>关闭 <code>--experimental-enable-lease-checkpoint</code>（默认 <code>false</code>），它会持久化 remainingTTL，官方描述其用途正是防止「长寿命租约被无限自动续约」（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/configuration/\">etcd Configuration</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>租约绑定 key 已被业务删除，但租约本身留着</td>\n<td>键不存在却仍占 <code>leaseMap</code></td>\n<td>泄漏检测脚本定期 revoke 空租约</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>清理动作必须<strong>限速</strong>。etcd 吊销过期租约的速率上限约为每秒 1000 个，大批量 <code>revoke</code> 会让过期删除的 Raft 提案挤占正常写入带宽，并推高 <code>etcd_debugging_mvcc_delete_total</code>。分批 revoke、每批之间留出若干秒观察 <code>etcd_disk_backend_commit_duration_seconds</code>，是把清理做成「可控」而非「二次事故」的关键。租约过期产生的删除还要走一遍日志复制，若此时有 follower 落后，清理延迟会与复制延迟叠加，判定入口见 <a href=\"../etcd-raft-log-replication/log-divergence-follower-lag-ops\">日志分歧修复、慢 Follower 与复制异常运维</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"watch-堆积-从-unsynced-到-errcompacted-的量化处置\">Watch 堆积：从 unsynced 到 ErrCompacted 的量化处置</h2><p>服务端把每个 Watch 消费者按能否跟上分成 <code>synced</code> / <code>unsynced</code> 两级，投递是<strong>非阻塞</strong>的：channel 满即移入 <code>victims</code>，由后台 goroutine 尝试搬回（机制细节见 <a href=\"lease-watch-stream-mechanism\">Lease 租约与 Watch 事件流机制</a>）。因此堆积在服务端表现为两个可观测信号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>etcd_debugging_mvcc_pending_events_total</code>：待发送事件总数。它上升说明产出速率超过了投递速率，通常是消费者或网络的问题，而非 etcd 本身。</li>\n<li><code>etcd_debugging_mvcc_slow_watcher_total</code>：进入 unsynced 的慢 watcher 计数。它与 <code>etcd_debugging_mvcc_watcher_total</code>、<code>etcd_debugging_mvcc_watch_stream_total</code> 一起定义「谁在拖后腿」（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/metrics/etcd-metrics-latest/\">etcd metrics</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>堆积变成<strong>硬失败</strong>的边界是压缩水位：当某 watcher 所需的 <code>StartRev</code> 已被 compact 掉，服务端置 <code>compact_revision</code>、取消该 watch，客户端收到 <code>mvcc: required revision has been compacted</code>，且用同一 <code>start_revision</code> 重建<strong>必然失败</strong>（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/learning/api/\">etcd API</a>）。这就是 Operator 类程序典型的「永久静默」故障。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消费缓慢但未丢事件</td>\n<td><code>pending_events_total</code> 上升，<code>slow_watcher_total</code> &gt; 0，无 ErrCompacted</td>\n<td>提升消费并发；用 <code>prev_kv=false</code> 减事件体积；<code>Fragment</code> 仅在超大事务时需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已跨过压缩水位</td>\n<td>客户端报 <code>ErrCompacted</code></td>\n<td>放弃断点续传，全量 List + 重新 Watch；并把持久化的 revision 与压缩窗口对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Watch 静默失效（连接被中间设备掐断）</td>\n<td><code>watcher_total</code> 下降但无 DELETE 事件</td>\n<td>调小 <code>--experimental-watch-progress-notify-interval</code>（默认 <code>10m</code>），叠加 gRPC keepalive</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大量 watcher 撑爆内存</td>\n<td><code>watcher_total</code> 远超预期</td>\n<td>把扇出收敛到代理层（如 apiserver 的 watch cache），etcd 只面对少量稳定订阅者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个必须记住的数字是 <strong>ProgressNotify 默认 10 分钟</strong>：长期无变更的 key 可能 10 分钟内收不到任何包，静默断链无从感知。跨境多可用区链路上中间 NAT/防火墙的空闲超时通常远小于 10 分钟，所以「watch 看起来还在、业务已不更新」几乎是跨区部署的默认故障，务必显式调小该间隔并叠加 keepalive。</p>\n<h2 id=\"压缩与-defrag-把空间真正还回去\">压缩与 defrag：把空间真正还回去</h2><p>压缩是 MVCC 里唯一真正的删除动作，它删除所有 main revision 小于目标值的历史版本、保留存活键的最新版本；defrag 才把释放出的空间还给文件系统（语义见 <a href=\"mvcc-revision-store-model\">MVCC 多版本存储模型</a>）。两者的自动/手动配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"etcd --auto-compaction-mode=periodic --auto-compaction-retention=1h&#10;etcd --auto-compaction-mode=revision --auto-compaction-retention=1000&#10;etcdctl compact 3&#10;etcdctl defrag --cluster&#10;etcdutl defrag --data-dir &lt;path-to-etcd-data-dir&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --auto-compaction-mode=periodic</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --auto-compaction-retention=1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --auto-compaction-mode=revision</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --auto-compaction-retention=1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compact</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> defrag</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cluster</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdutl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> defrag</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --data-dir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">path-to-etcd-data-di</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>参数取值有官方口径可循（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/maintenance/\">etcd Maintenance</a>）：<code>periodic</code> 模式下，频繁更新的键建议 <code>1h</code> 或 <code>30m</code>，不常更新的建议 <code>24h</code> / <code>48h</code> / <code>72h</code>，通用值 <code>10h</code>；<code>revision</code> 模式每 <strong>5 分钟</strong>检查一次，压缩到 <code>latest - N</code>。租约密集型负载建议用 <code>revision</code> 模式——它以「保留多少 revision」为界，比时间窗更能约束「批量过期产生海量 tombstone」场景下的 lag。</p>\n<p>defrag 的代价必须提前讲清：<strong>它在活跃成员上会阻塞读写</strong>，直到状态重建完毕（官方明确警告，并给出 <code>etcd_disk_backend_defrag_duration_seconds</code> 指标）。因此：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用 <code>--cluster</code> 逐成员串行 defrag，不要在三个成员上同时手动触发；</li>\n<li>对已停止的成员用 <code>etcdutl defrag --data-dir</code> 离线做，避免在线阻塞；</li>\n<li>空间紧张到 defrag 被 OOM 杀死时，先 compact 并把 <code>--quota-backend-bytes</code> 调高争取窗口，再逐成员 defrag。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>单次压缩的批处理量受 <code>--experimental-compaction-batch-limit</code> 约束（默认 <code>1000</code>，即每批最多移除 1000 个 revision）；<code>--max-wals</code>（默认 <code>5</code>）与 <code>--max-snapshots</code>（默认 <code>5</code>）控制 WAL/快照保留数，<code>--quota-backend-bytes</code> 默认保守配额（生产常见调到 8GiB，<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/configuration/\">etcd Configuration</a>）。</p>\n<p>配额耗尽时 etcd 进入<strong>集群级只读</strong>：抛 <code>NOSPACE</code> alarm，只接受读和删除，客户端拿到 gRPC code 8 的 <code>database space exceeded</code>。恢复序列是固定的四步（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/maintenance/\">etcd Maintenance</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"ETCDCTL_API=3 etcdctl alarm list&#10;ETCDCTL_API=3 etcdctl compact $rev      # rev 取当前 revision&#10;ETCDCTL_API=3 etcdctl defrag&#10;ETCDCTL_API=3 etcdctl alarm disarm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ETCDCTL_API</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alarm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ETCDCTL_API</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $rev      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># rev 取当前 revision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ETCDCTL_API</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> defrag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ETCDCTL_API</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alarm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> disarm</span></span></code></pre></div><p>要点是 <code>compact</code> 必须压到当前 revision，<code>defrag</code> 要等到压缩真正完成，最后才 <code>alarm disarm</code>——顺序颠倒会导致 alarm 立即复发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>租约泄漏、Watch 堆积、压缩滞后共用同一套 revision 空间：租约只决定<strong>何时</strong>产生删除提案，Watch 决定这些事件由<strong>谁</strong>消费，压缩决定历史<strong>能留多久</strong>。可落地的闭环是三条定量线：用 <code>granted - revoked - expired</code> 的差值监控租约净增长并限速清理空租约；用 <code>pending_events_total</code> 与 <code>slow_watcher_total</code> 判定堆积、在跨过压缩水位前修消费或放弃断点续传；用 <code>db_total_size_in_bytes</code> 与 <code>in_use</code> 之差决定 compact/defrag 时机，并严格遵守「compact → defrag → disarm」顺序。把这三条线写进容量评审与发布检查单，跨境多可用区 etcd 的「内存只涨不降」和「集群突然只读」两类事故都可以在设计阶段消掉。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"租约泄漏、Watch 堆积与压缩调优实操","id":"租约泄漏-watch-堆积与压缩调优实操"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三种「泄漏」共用一套 MVCC 计数","id":"核心概念-三种-泄漏-共用一套-mvcc-计数"},{"level":2,"text":"租约泄漏：识别、归因与清理","id":"租约泄漏-识别-归因与清理"},{"level":2,"text":"Watch 堆积：从 unsynced 到 ErrCompacted 的量化处置","id":"watch-堆积-从-unsynced-到-errcompacted-的量化处置"},{"level":2,"text":"压缩与 defrag：把空间真正还回去","id":"压缩与-defrag-把空间真正还回去"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Lease 租约与 Watch 事件流机制：TTL 续约、惰性过期与流式 MVCC 通知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/lease-watch-mvcc/lease-watch-stream-mechanism"},"next":{"title":"集群成员与 Quorum 模型：learner、投票权与成员变更","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/cluster-maintenance/cluster-membership-quorum-model"}}